          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Pour a quarter cup of water on a clean, dry, well-used area and leave it fifteen minutes. If wiping it away leaves a dark patch that takes time to fade, that area needs sealing. Test three fixed spots annually: beside the sink, near the cooktop, and on the island."
          }
