          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Replace the calendar with a cup of water. One annual test on three fixed spots tells you what your countertop needs, which is more than any general rule about granite can do.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most kitchens that means sealing every three to five years, spot treating the sink run in between, and leaving a dense black slab alone entirely. Less work than the annual ritual, and considerably better protection.
          </p>
